    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n120" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ab-lūdo</span></b> , si, sum, 3,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>v. n.;</i>
			meton. (like the Greek <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπᾴδειν</span>),
				<i>not to agree with</i> or <i>resemble</i>, <i>to differ from</i>, <i>be unlike</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haec a te non multum abludit imago,</span>”
				<i>is not much unlike thee</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					S. 2, 3, 320</span></i>
			 (= abhorret, discrepat).</div>
